  paragraphs:
    - "The&nbsp;Brazee Grant&nbsp;Estate Sale is a charming Tudor full of charming vintage treasures. There are all kinds of wonders awaiting in this estate from iconic pieces to nostalgic keepsakes. From midcentury modern tables and oak furniture, to sofas and chairs, and oriental rugs. The diverse array of fine art and Native American pieces, to the timeless grandfather clock, everything in this home is glowing with fun and quirky items. All kinds of kitchen items including pots and pans, china, glassware, small appliances like malt milkshake makers, and bakeware. Lots of books, magazines, comics, and vinyl&nbsp;records, plus classic boardgames and collectable&nbsp;toys.&nbsp;"
